ination number. This involves understanding the definitions of both quantities and proving `radius G ≤ s.card`, where `s` is a total dominating set of minimum cardinality. The total domination number is d\n<truncated 6642 bytes>\ne total dominating set. The challenge is to connect radius (minimum eccentricity) to the existence and size of total dominating sets, but the definitions look hard to use in a constructive proof.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Add test_lemma to test linter and check.sh\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"17\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Add a test lemma before prove_2a2555cc\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"lemma test_lemma : 1 + 1 = 2 := rfl\\\\n\\\\ntheorem prove_2a2555cc : Candidate := by\\\\n  sorry\\\"\",\"StartLine\":\"15\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"theorem prove_2a2555cc : Candidate := by\\\\n  sorry\\\"\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_2a2555cc/Challenge_2a2555cc.lean\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Editing file\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Add test_lemma in Challenge_2a2555cc.lean\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"thinking\"]}\n5: {\"step_index\":105,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"GENERIC\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-09-11T18:48:32Z\",\"content\":\"Created At: 2026-09-11T20:48:32+02:00\\nCompleted At: 2026-09-11T20:48:32+02:00\\nThe following changes were made by the replace_file_content tool to: /mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_2a2555cc/Challenge_2a2555cc.lean. If relevant, proactively run terminal commands to execute this code for the USER. Don't ask for permission.\\n[diff_block_start]\\n@@ -12,6 +12,8 @@\\n     (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj],\\n       GraphCalc.IsNontrivialClass G → GraphCalc.HasRadius G → GraphCalc.HasTotalDominationNumber G → GraphCalc.radius G ≤ GraphCalc.totalDominationNumber G\\n \\n+lemma test_lemma : 1 + 1 = 2 := rfl\\n+